    <bpmn:process id="W_W5421" name="W5421. Connected-Retail-Device Onboarding Security Gate (POS, SCO, RF, Locker, EV, BMS)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New connected-device procurement/deployment (new POS model, SCO rollout VS-149, smart-locker VS-164, EV host VS-163, BMS upgrade VS-138, solar SCADA VS-108, IoT sensor VS-69)
Frequency: Per new device/channel/model — ~10–30 onboarding events/yr across channels + new-store/DC commissioning
Volume: ~600 POS + ~per-store SCO/locker/EV/BMS at ~10–15 new stores/yr + refresh cycles
Owner: OT Security Lead
Participants: Procurement (VS-34), IT Asset Mgmt (VS-99), Store Opening (VS-37), IFM (VS-138), VS-163/VS-164/VS-149 channel owners, VS-161 TPRM
Source: workflow W5421 — Connected-Retail-Device Onboarding Security Gate (POS, SCO, RF, Locker, EV, BMS)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5421_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5421_Lane1" name="OT Security Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5421_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5421_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5421_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5421_Lane2" name="OT Security Engineer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5421_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5421_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5421_Lane3" name="OT Security Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5421_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
