        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-800 (ensure controlled execution — OT Asset Inventory, Architecture &amp; IT/OT Segmentation Governance (PA-190.1).) | - operational: asset inventory/onboarding gate; secure configuration; TPRM/vendor security; operational: no connected retail device commissioned without a recorded OT security review.
Owner: OT Security Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
