    <bpmn:process id="W_W5422" name="W5422. OT Network Architecture Review, Firewall Rule &amp; Zone-Boundary Lifecycle" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly lifecycle review; post-incident (W5430); major change (new channel/site)
