Accountable (A): Change Advisory Board
Duration: per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5422_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5422_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
