    <bpmn:process id="W_W5423" name="W5423. OT Asset End-of-Life Security, Secure Decommissioning &amp; Cryptographic Erase" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Device refresh/replacement (VS-99 lifecycle), store closure (VS-59), remodel (VS-109), vendor swap
Frequency: Per device retirement — ~1,000–3,000 OT device retirements/yr across refresh cycles
Volume: POS (600 on a refresh), BMS/fire/access panels, SCADA/PLC, SCO/locker/EV controllers, RF/weighbridge
Owner: OT Security Lead
Participants: IT Asset Mgmt (VS-99), IFM (VS-138), Store Ops (VS-07), records/retention (VS-88)
Source: workflow W5423 — OT Asset End-of-Life Security, Secure Decommissioning &amp; Cryptographic Erase</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5423_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5423_Lane1" name="OT Security Engineer">
