        <bpmn:outgoing>W5423_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5423_Task6" name="Before physical removal: revoke credentials, close vendor remote access…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Before physical removal: revoke credentials, close vendor remote access (W5433), and disconnect from the network/zone.
Responsible (R): OT Security Engineer
Accountable (A): OT Security Lead
Duration: per device</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5423_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5423_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5423_Task7" name="For devices holding data (POS, SCO, BMS historian, SCADA logger, access-control…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: For devices holding data (POS, SCO, BMS historian, SCADA logger, access-control DB): perform cryptographic/logical erase per VS-99 W3254 and verify.
Responsible (R): OT Security Engineer
Accountable (A): OT Security Lead
Duration: per device</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5423_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5423_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5423_Task8" name="For controller/PLC devices: reset to factory, remove engineering programs, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: For controller/PLC devices: reset to factory, remove engineering programs, and confirm no residual site-specific logic/config.
Responsible (R): OT Security Engineer / Vendor
Accountable (A): OT Security Lead
Duration: per device</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5423_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5423_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5423_Task9" name="Update the OT asset register (W5417) to retired; retain decommissioning…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Update the OT asset register (W5417) to retired; retain decommissioning evidence per records retention (VS-88, BIR 10-yr).
Responsible (R): OT Security Analyst
Accountable (A): OT Security Lead
Duration: per device</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5423_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5423_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5423_Task10" name="Coordinate secure disposal/recycling (VS-73/VS-99 W3254 e-waste) so no…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Coordinate secure disposal/recycling (VS-73/VS-99 W3254 e-waste) so no controller with site logic or credentials is resold or landfilled.
Responsible (R): IT Asset Mgmt
Accountable (A): OT Security Lead
Duration: per device</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5423_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5423_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5423_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5423_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-800 (ensure controlled execution — OT Asset Inventory, Architecture &amp; IT/OT Segmentation Governance (PA-190.1).) | - operational: asset register retirement; secure disposal/erase; data retention — extended to OT; operational: verified erase evidence before any device leaves BuildRight control.
Owner: OT Security Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
