    <bpmn:process id="W_W5424" name="W5424. OT Security Posture Dashboard, Criticality Tiering &amp; Risk Acceptance Register" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly governance cycle; board/audit risk reporting (VS-21.2/VS-36); new finding
Frequency: Monthly dashboard; quarterly tiering/risk-acceptance review
Volume: 1 OT security posture dashboard + ~1 risk register
Owner: OT Security Lead
Participants: CIO, IT Security Manager/IT Security (VS-27.3), Internal Audit (VS-21), ERM (VS-21.2), HSE (VS-24), Insurance (VS-26)
Source: workflow W5424 — OT Security Posture Dashboard, Criticality Tiering &amp; Risk Acceptance Register</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5424_LaneSet3">
