      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5424_Start4" name="Monthly governance cycle; board/audit risk reporting (VS-21.2/VS-36); new finding">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5424_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5424_Task5" name="Aggregate OT posture: asset coverage (W5417), segmentation hygiene (W5422)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Aggregate OT posture: asset coverage (W5417), segmentation hygiene (W5422), default-cred/baseline compliance (W5419/W5420), open vulnerabilities (W5427), incidents (W5430), third-party access (W5433).
Responsible (R): OT Security Analyst
Accountable (A): OT Security Lead
Duration: monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5424_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5424_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5424_Task6" name="Maintain the OT criticality tiering (Safety-of-life / Store-closing / Revenue /…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Maintain the OT criticality tiering (Safety-of-life / Store-closing / Revenue / Operational) driving prioritization.
Responsible (R): OT Security Lead
Accountable (A): OT Security Lead
Duration: quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5424_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5424_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5424_Task7" name="Log accepted OT risks (where remediation is deferred for ops/safety/cost…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Log accepted OT risks (where remediation is deferred for ops/safety/cost reasons) with owner, expiry, and compensating control.
Responsible (R): OT Security Lead
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: per risk</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5424_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5424_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5424_Task8" name="Feed OT cyber risk into enterprise risk management (VS-21.2), cyber-insurance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Feed OT cyber risk into enterprise risk management (VS-21.2), cyber-insurance underwriting (VS-26), and board reporting (VS-36).
Responsible (R): OT Security Lead
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5424_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5424_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
